stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Submitted : create
    Submitted --> UnderReview : start review (Reviewer)
    UnderReview --> Approved : approve (Reviewer)
    UnderReview --> Rejected : reject + reason (Reviewer)
    Approved --> Assigned : assign engineer (Reviewer)
    Assigned --> InProgress : start work (Assignee)
    InProgress --> Assigned : reassign to another engineer (Reviewer)
    InProgress --> Resolved : resolve + summary (Assignee)
    Resolved --> Closed : close (Requester / Reviewer)
    Resolved --> Reopened : reopen + reason (Requester / Reviewer)
    Reopened --> InProgress : resume work (Assignee)
    Rejected --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]

    UnderReview : Under Review
    InProgress : In Progress
